  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: Ta
    Lines:
    - "Kho\u1EA3ng c\xE1ch kh\xE9p l\u1EA1i. N\u1ECF \u0110inh b\u1EAFn lo\u1EA1t
      \u0111\u1EA7u t\u1EA7m g\u1EA7n, d\xE2y b\u1EADt ti\u1EBFng kh\xF4. L\xEDnh
      n\u1ECF l\xF9i n\u1EEDa b\u01B0\u1EDBc, h\xE0ng gi\xE1o tr\xE0n l\xEAn, m\u0169i
      \u0111\xF3n ngay g\u1ED1i ng\u1EF1a. K\u1EF5 Ki\u1EC1u ch\xE9m d\u1ECDc tr\u1EE5c
      \u0111\u1EC3 ph\xE1 c\xE1n, lao d\u1EF1 ph\xF2ng qu\xE9t ch\xE9o v\xE0o c\u1ED5
      tay c\u1EA7m gi\xE1o. \u0110\u1EA5t \u1EA9m, b\xF9n b\u1EAFn k\xEDn \u1ED1ng
      ch\xE2n. Ti\u1EBFng h\xED, ti\u1EBFng th\xE9t h\xF2a th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t d\u1EA3i."
